{"total_count":10,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RodrigoValecred/Valecred2/issues/486","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RodrigoValecred/Valecred2","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RodrigoValecred/Valecred2/issues/486/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RodrigoValecred/Valecred2/issues/486/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RodrigoValecred/Valecred2/issues/486/events","html_url":"https://github.com/RodrigoValecred/Valecred2/pull/486","id":4051964494,"node_id":"PR_kwDOQGBt4M7JZKxR","number":486,"title":"Fix prazo_medio calculations for OPERACOES in Relatório Mensal","user":{"login":"RodrigoValecred","id":205034931,"node_id":"U_kgDODDiVsw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/205034931?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RodrigoValecred","html_url":"https://github.com/RodrigoValecred","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RodrigoValecred/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RodrigoValecred/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RodrigoValecred/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RodrigoValecred/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RodrigoValecred/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RodrigoValecred/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RodrigoValecred/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RodrigoValecred/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RodrigoValecred/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-03-10T13:52:41Z","updated_at":"2026-03-10T14:08:39Z","closed_at":"2026-03-10T14:06:53Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RodrigoValecred/Valecred2/pulls/486","html_url":"https://github.com/RodrigoValecred/Valecred2/pull/486","diff_url":"https://github.com/RodrigoValecred/Valecred2/pull/486.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/RodrigoValecred/Valecred2/pull/486.patch","merged_at":"2026-03-10T14:06:53Z"},"body":"Fixes the issue where prazo_medio_total_dias and related metrics were incorrectly calculated in the Relatório Mensal de Produtos por Cliente. By utilizing `prazo_medio_ponderado_dias` as the single source of truth for the operation's total term and backing out the `floating` period, the metric now matches the expected logic.\n\n---\n*PR created automatically by Jules for task [15630918965387673817](https://jules.google.com/task/15630918965387673817) started by @RodrigoValecred*","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RodrigoValecred/Valecred2/issues/486/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RodrigoValecred/Valecred2/issues/486/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uktrade/redbox/issues/797","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uktrade/redbox","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uktrade/redbox/issues/797/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uktrade/redbox/issues/797/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uktrade/redbox/issues/797/events","html_url":"https://github.com/uktrade/redbox/pull/797","id":3896889379,"node_id":"PR_kwDONnCyjM7Be_-m","number":797,"title":"Release v2.2.1","user":{"login":"antone-bagnall","id":242437249,"node_id":"U_kgDODnNMgQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/242437249?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/antone-bagnall","html_url":"https://github.com/antone-bagnall","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antone-bagnall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antone-bagnall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antone-bagnall/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antone-bagnall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antone-bagnall/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antone-bagnall/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antone-bagnall/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antone-bagnall/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antone-bagnall/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-02-04T14:40:48Z","updated_at":"2026-02-04T16:54:26Z","closed_at":"2026-02-04T16:54:24Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uktrade/redbox/pulls/797","html_url":"https://github.com/uktrade/redbox/pull/797","diff_url":"https://github.com/uktrade/redbox/pull/797.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/uktrade/redbox/pull/797.patch","merged_at":"2026-02-04T16:54:24Z"},"body":"This update focuses on simplifying the document processing architecture and refining the evaluation framework to improve developer experience and system performance.\r\n\r\n🚀 Key Changes\r\nDecoupled Evaluation from Ingest: The evaluation logic has been separated from the standard document ingestion pipeline. This allows developers to run evaluations independently without triggering full re-indexing, saving significant time and compute resources.\r\n\r\nSimplified Metadata Handling: Streamlined how document metadata is passed through the system, reducing the complexity of the data models and improving the reliability of document retrieval.\r\n\r\nEnhanced Logging for Ingest: Added more granular logging during the ingestion process to help identify and debug issues with specific file types or large datasets more effectively.\r\n\r\n🔧 Technical Refinements\r\nCode Cleanup: Removed deprecated ingestion scripts and redundant utility functions to maintain a cleaner codebase.\r\n\r\nImproved Error Handling: Refined the error catching mechanism within the worker tasks to ensure that a single malformed document does not halt the entire ingestion batch.\r\n\r\nTest Suite Updates: Updated the integration tests to reflect the new decoupled structure, ensuring better coverage for both the ingest and evaluation workflows.\r\n\r\n🐛 Bug Fixes\r\nFixed a bug where certain evaluation metrics were being calculated incorrectly due to overlapping document chunks.\r\n\r\nResolved an issue where temporary files created during the ingestion process were not being properly cleaned up in the worker environment.\r\n\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uktrade/redbox/issues/797/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uktrade/redbox/issues/797/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ray-project/ray/issues/60234","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ray-project/ray","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ray-project/ray/issues/60234/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ray-project/ray/issues/60234/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ray-project/ray/issues/60234/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ray-project/ray/pull/60234","id":3823259255,"node_id":"PR_kwDOBEmZvc69rttO","number":60234,"title":"[RLLib] Fix module episode returns metrics accumulation for shared module IDs","user":{"login":"akelloway","id":21093303,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMDkzMzAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21093303?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akelloway","html_url":"https://github.com/akelloway","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akelloway/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akelloway/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akelloway/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akelloway/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akelloway/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akelloway/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akelloway/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akelloway/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akelloway/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":2989996529,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyOTg5OTk2NTI5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ray-project/ray/labels/rllib","name":"rllib","color":"A203BB","default":false,"description":"RLlib related issues"},{"id":4164120592,"node_id":"LA_kwDOBEmZvc74M3AQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ray-project/ray/labels/rllib-logging","name":"rllib-logging","color":"A203BB","default":false,"description":"This problem is related to logging metrics"},{"id":6926977571,"node_id":"LA_kwDOBEmZvc8AAAABnOFKIw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ray-project/ray/labels/go","name":"go","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"add ONLY when ready to merge, run all tests"},{"id":8400362697,"node_id":"LA_kwDOBEmZvc8AAAAB9LNcyQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ray-project/ray/labels/community-contribution","name":"community-contribution","color":"C5DEF5","default":false,"description":"Contributed by the community"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-01-16T19:08:01Z","updated_at":"2026-01-20T19:40:40Z","closed_at":"2026-01-20T19:40:40Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ray-project/ray/pulls/60234","html_url":"https://github.com/ray-project/ray/pull/60234","diff_url":"https://github.com/ray-project/ray/pull/60234.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/ray-project/ray/pull/60234.patch","merged_at":"2026-01-20T19:40:40Z"},"body":"### Description\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes a bug in the RLLib `MultiAgentEnvRunner` where module episode returns metrics were incorrectly calculated when multiple agents share the same module ID. Previously, the code was overwriting returns instead of accumulating them, leading to incorrect metrics.\r\n\r\n- Fixed module return calculation logic in `MultiAgentEnvRunner` to properly accumulate returns when multiple agents use the same module ID\r\n- Added test case to verify that module metrics returns equal the sum of agent returns assigned to that module\r\n\r\n### Related issues\r\nFixes #59860 (https://github.com/ray-project/ray/issues/59860)\r\n\r\n### Files modified:\r\n- `rllib/env/multi_agent_env_runner.py`: Core bug fix\r\n- `rllib/env/tests/test_multi_agent_env_runner.py`: New test case called `test_module_metrics_returns_equal_sum_of_agent_returns()`","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ray-project/ray/issues/60234/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ray-project/ray/issues/60234/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/streamer45/streamkit/issues/31","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/streamer45/streamkit","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/streamer45/streamkit/issues/31/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/streamer45/streamkit/issues/31/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/streamer45/streamkit/issues/31/events","html_url":"https://github.com/streamer45/streamkit/pu