84.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/palomachain/paloma/pull/1084.patch","merged_at":"2024-02-08T14:39:13Z"},"body":"# Related Github tickets\r\n\r\n- https://github.com/VolumeFi/paloma/issues/421\r\n\r\n# Background\r\n\r\nSome of our metrics were calculated incorrectly. This fix should address the issue.\r\n\r\n# Testing completed\r\n\r\n- [x] test coverage exists or has been added/updated\r\n- [ ] tested in a private testnet\r\n\r\n# Breaking changes\r\n\r\n- [x] I have checked my code for breaking changes\r\n- [x] If there are breaking changes, there is a supporting migration.\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/palomachain/paloma/issues/1084/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/palomachain/paloma/issues/1084/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}